      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Gao Daxing: Xie Tian said “I heard you went out for a meal with a guy, an ugly guy. Come home now!”"
    },
    {
