    "sentence_translations": [
      "Why did you watch a movie alone?",
      "",
      "Mao Huan: I heard that you went for dinner with a pretty girl yesterday. How did it go? How did it go? Say something.",
      "",
      "Gao Daxing: Xie Tian’s sister and I went to a restaurant and watched a movie together yesterday. Do you know her?",
      "",
      "Mao Huan: I don’t know her. Which movie did you watch?",
      "",
      "Gao Daxing: We watched a Chinese movie from 1983. It’s called “one and eight”.",
      "",
      "Mao Huan: How was it? Is it good?",
      "",
      "Gao Daxing: The movie is very nice. But Xie Tian gave her a call when we watched the movie.",
      "",
      "Mao Huan: What did he say to his sister?",
      "",
      "Gao Daxing: Xie Tian said “I heard you went out for a meal with a guy, an ugly guy. Come home now!”",
      "",
      "Mao Huan: Ah?",
      "",
      "Gao Daxing: It’s okay. I like watching movies alone…"
